{"path":"string/basic_string/assign_range","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::assign_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>assign_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/assign_range","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the contents of the string with the values in the range rg.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> assign_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the contents of the string with the values in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to \n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> assign<span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/from_range\"><span class=\"kw3602\">std::<span class=\"me2\">from_range</span></span></a>,\n        std​<span class=\"sy4\">::</span>​forward<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n        get_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in size of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>If the operation would cause <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/size\"><code>size()</code></a></code> to exceed <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/max_size\"><code>max_size()</code></a></code>, throws <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/length_error\">std::length_error</a></span>.\n</p><p>If an exception is thrown for any reason, this function has no effect (<a href=\"/w/cpp/language/exceptions#Exception_safety\">strong exception safety guarantee</a>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_containers_ranges\"><code>__cpp_lib_containers_ranges</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/23#cpp_lib_containers_ranges_202202L\"><code>202202L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++23)</span></td>\n<td>member functions that accept <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>\n</td></tr>